{"3253950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Awaking Beauty", "steam_appid": 3253950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot mechas and dive into the Dreamscape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaking Beauty</strong> is a roguelite action game where you play as chosen high school girls, fighting and rescuing Dream Prisoners in a realm where sci-fi and fantasy intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a coming-of-age adventure about girls joining forces to save the world, and redeeming each other in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※ Playable in single-player or two-player modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/4d9e9e0e8af4107ad0ebd9d71ea15b17.poster.avif?t=1784319497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/4d9e9e0e8af4107ad0ebd9d71ea15b17.webm?t=1784319497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/4d9e9e0e8af4107ad0ebd9d71ea15b17.mp4?t=1784319497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ Beat 'em up Roguelite ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique dream-themed adventure presented as a Beat 'em up within the Roguelite genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ Multiple Character Selection ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New companions will join as the story progresses. Before venturing into the Dreamworld, players can strategically select their characters to suit their playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ A Story Where Dreams and Reality Intertwine ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Materials that manifest in dreams originate from real-world memories. As the girls repeatedly delve into the dreamworld, they must not only battle Nightmares but also confront bizarre human fantasies and the hollow voids within one another's hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ Dream-Flash Turbo ｘ Mecha Fusion ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieving perfect synchronization and resonance, the duo fuses into the ultimate mecha form, crushing all Nightmares on the field with invincible power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Please wishlist Awaking Beauty and follow for Demo updates ◆<br>&quot;We need your feedback&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in development, and we look forward to hearing from our players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to let us know what you love most and what could be improved. Your wishes might just come true!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot mechas and dive into the Dreamscape! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaking Beauty</strong> is a roguelite action game where you play as chosen high school girls, fighting and rescuing Dream Prisoners in a realm where sci-fi and fantasy intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a coming-of-age adventure about girls joining forces to save the world, and redeeming each other in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※ Playable in single-player or two-player modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/4d9e9e0e8af4107ad0ebd9d71ea15b17.poster.avif?t=1784319497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/4d9e9e0e8af4107ad0ebd9d71ea15b17.webm?t=1784319497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/4d9e9e0e8af4107ad0ebd9d71ea15b17.mp4?t=1784319497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ Beat 'em up Roguelite ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique dream-themed adventure presented as a Beat 'em up within the Roguelite genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ Multiple Character Selection ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New companions will join as the story progresses. Before venturing into the Dreamworld, players can strategically select their characters to suit their playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ A Story Where Dreams and Reality Intertwine ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Materials that manifest in dreams originate from real-world memories. As the girls repeatedly delve into the dreamworld, they must not only battle Nightmares but also confront bizarre human fantasies and the hollow voids within one another's hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆ Dream-Flash Turbo ｘ Mecha Fusion ◆</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieving perfect synchronization and resonance, the duo fuses into the ultimate mecha form, crushing all Nightmares on the field with invincible power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1784319497 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Please wishlist Awaking Beauty and follow for Demo updates ◆<br>&quot;We need your feedback&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in development, and we look forward to hearing from our players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to let us know what you love most and what could be improved. Your wishes might just come true!</p>", "short_description": "Awaking Beauty is an action roguelite beat 'em up game. Play as high school girls piloting Dream Mechas, activate the Dream Flash Turbine to combine and transform, and team up with your partner to save the Dreamscape! ※ Play solo or team up with a friend.", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/0f30033816eabef8309c66a8ee3f9887c0de0014/header.jpg?t=1784319497", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/f2814593eb4145d6002a5cef145d55ae80bf4465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t